<title>CROATIA: Croatian stocks flat on higher turnover.</title>
<headline>Croatian stocks flat on higher turnover.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatian stocks were mostly flat on higher turnover Wednesday.</p>
<p>* Of six traded issues four were flat, two down.</p>
<p>* Turnover 5,5 million kuna, volume 6,552 shares.</p>
<p>* Biggest decliner, food processor Podravka, lost 5 kuna to 215, on volume of 1,781 shares.</p>
<p>* Most active issue Zagrebacka Banka was flat at 980 kuna, selling 3,840 shares.</p>
<p>(1$=5.5436 kuna) -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
